  "source_findings": [
    "Only first failed allowlisted actual load-ihk/load-smp/load-mcctrl/boot helper is retained, by value including inline stream arrays, genuine supervisor status/timestamps/child fault, and evidence-save-failure flag after all helper save attempts. Later failures cannot replace it.",
    "Literal allowlisted tags have static lifetime; no borrowed stack stream pointer or ownership transfer. Unsafe cleanup suppresses publication.",
    "For unstarted payload only, one ND_HELPER_FAIL frame replaces old unstarted ND_PAYLOAD frame. Successful helper/payload route uses unchanged publish. No extra frame or success acceptance generated.",
    "M03 stream1024B each, frame4096B, PIPE_BUF atomic write and all deadlines unchanged. Fallback explicitly marks omitted stream hex while retaining original captured byte counts and actual status/helper identity. Invalid kept/observed bounds refuse.",
    "Evaluator and strict73B stdout/EINVAL/data/write/unmap/exit oracle unchanged; ND_HELPER_FAIL is failure evidence only."
  ],
